LETTER REPORTS

  O King of Kings, thy heroes have travelled around the globe in
search of adventure and conquest.  I have faithfully kept their
correspondence, and now I present it to thee:


From: Berthier, Squire to Turquine
To: Cho'gor

  Honored Sovereign, 

  Frigid winter melted into sweet spring, and Turquine made ready to carry 
out his urgent assignments.  He prepared his forces to defend Taiwan and the 
surrounding provinces.

  Thy humble servant,   Berthier, Squire to Turquine


